# sha256 of the reference artifacts the full-window state boundaries are
# checked against (kept outside git; files are not part of this repository):
#   ulcnet_d4 / ulcnet_d8     Align-ULCNet D=4 / D=8, layout 17 graph (combined hidden)
#   deepvqe_s_d32             DeepVQE-S D=32, layout 3 graph
# Weights are seeded random (stub checkpoints, no trained model); each trace is
# 2*D+5 hops of seeded random spectra with every graph input and output stored.
# Layout 18 / layout 4 graphs are required to reproduce the recorded heads and
# states exactly (new *_out == the old Concat, old *_out == new minus the
# dropped slot).
